{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc 'cat /Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/d375-measure/packet-v12-2.md'","aggregated_output":"# Packet v12-2\n\n**The question:** At NVIDIA’s FY2027 annual report, what amount of purchase commitments for the Hugging Face acquisition will NVIDIA report in its commitments note?\n\nDue 2027-02-28. Possible answers:\n- 1 Strongly bullish: The reported amount is less than $5 billion.\n- 2 Bullish: The reported amount is at least $5 billion and less than $10 billion.\n- 3 Neutral: The reported amount is at least $10 billion and less than $15 billion.\n- 4 Bearish: The reported amount is at least $15 billion and less than $20 billion.\n- 5 Strongly bearish: The reported amount is at least $20 billion.\n\n**7 statements read on 2026-09-25:**\n\n- **v12-2-1** (stored attribution: Colette Kress, NVIDIA CFO): NVIDIA CFO Colette Kress said gross margin should be 72% to 73% in fiscal 2028, after bottoming at 71% to 72% in fiscal Q4 2027 as price increases take effect.\n  - Passage: \"On the call, Kress said gross margins should bottom between 71% and 72% in the fiscal fourth quarter and then settle at 72% to 73% in fiscal 2028 as price hikes kick in.\"\n- **v12-2-2** (stored attribution: NVIDIA): NVIDIA reported FY2027 second-quarter revenue of $96.2 billion, up 106% year over year and 18% sequentially.\n  - Passage: \"NVIDIA's revenue growth has been phenomenal, reaching $96.2 billion in the fiscal second quarter of 2027, up 106% year over year and 18% sequentially, according to the company's Aug. 26 press release.\"\n- **v12-2-3** (stored attribution: SpaceX unit): A SpaceX unit said it plans to equip its Memphis facility with 1 million graphics processing units by 2026.\n  - Passage: \"The SpaceX unit previously said it plans to equip its Memphis facility with 1 million graphics processing units by 2026.\"\n- **v12-2-4** (stored attribution: RMX Industries, Inc.): RMX announced on September 25, 2026, that it signed a compute supply purchase order with Technologent for NVIDIA H200 GPU systems for QuantrusX deployments.\n  - Passage: \"RMX Industries, Inc. (\"RMX\" or the \"Company\") (OTCQB: RMXI), an edge intelligence company delivering QuantrusX™, today announced it has signed a compute supply purchase order with Technologent for NVIDIA H200 GPU systems that will power QuantrusX™ deployments.\"\n- **v12-2-5** (stored attribution: Susquehanna analyst Mehdi Hosseini): Susquehanna analyst Mehdi Hosseini said some of the revenue Micron expects from the Nvidia product ramp would shift from this year to next year; no amount was given.\n  - Passage: \"Hosseini said some estimated revenue is expected to shift toward next year instead of this year, according to MarketWatch.\"\n- **v12-2-6** (stored attribution: fool.com (analyst)): The author judged that NVIDIA could reach a $7 trillion market value around January 2028 if it delivers its forecast fiscal 2028 results and receives Broadcom's current forward earnings multiple.\n  - Passage: \"If Nvidia delivers the year it has forecast, and the market prices those earnings the way it prices Broadcom's today, $7 trillion arrives somewhere on that timeline.\"\n- **v12-2-7** (stored attribution: NVIDIA): MarketBeat reports that NVIDIA forecasts doubling its chip volume next year (2027).\n  - Passage: \"NVIDIA's (NASDAQ: NVDA) forecast to double its chip volume next year strengthens an already bullish growth outlook for the company and its stock.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"item\":\"v12-2-1\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"The margin forecast does not give or change the acquisition purchase commitments.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v12-2-2\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"NVIDIA's quarterly revenue does not establish the acquisition purchase commitments.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v12-2-3\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"The GPU deployment plan does not concern NVIDIA's acquisition purchase commitments.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v12-2-4\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"RMX's GPU purchase order does not concern NVIDIA's acquisition purchase commitments.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v12-2-5\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"The timing of Micron's expected revenue does not establish the acquisition purchase commitments.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v12-2-6\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"The market value estimate does not establish the acquisition purchase commitments.\"}\n{\"item\":\"v12-2-7\",\"bears\":\"no\",\"why\":\"The chip volume forecast does not establish the acquisition purchase commitments.\"}\n{\"done\":true,\"items\":7}"}}
